    "price_level": 1,
    "rating": 4.1,
    "reference": "ChIJ4_q3Wlc3yUwRdjuOW90kpVo",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kid JL",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109437005942111746787/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmatjpkzwM-KNB2JSaZcgRg-sBGjirtYgly_C_mpCRt1ZDzFs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Service was friendly and quick. She managed to serve us 9 drinks under 15 minutes despite being alone in the store. The drinks tasted great. A bit too sweet for me personally but they do have the option to put less sugar, which I would definitely go for next time. The place is also pretty clean which makes it the place better. For a large drink, it's only around 5$ which is cheaper than a lot of other bubble tea places.",
        "time": 1653409176,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "GL Francesco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110072676030755007025/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZWaf0Cvcmcw8PyWkgh5Pz4Xe03Key7vcAl8R39jGetPcsjawVYw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I recently visited L2 Bubble Tea and was blown away by the quality of the drinks and the friendly service.\n\nBut what really sets L2 apart is the variety of flavors on offer. There are so many options to choose from, and each one is unique and delicious. I particularly enjoyed the coffee caramel macchiato with tapioca pearls.\n\nThe staff at L2 were also top-notch. They were friendly and welcoming, and they were more than happy to make recommendations and answer any questions I had. Overall, I had an excellent experience at L2 Bubble Tea and would highly recommend it to anyone in the area looking for a delicious and refreshing drink.",
        "time": 1672183353,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Cool to finally get bubble tea in Vaudreuil! I had the oolong tea with milk and tapioca; the milk tasted more creamer than milk. The bubble (tapioca) is sweetened and chewy; nice oolong tea flavour. Not as authentic as the ones in Taiwan, where bubble milk tea is originally created, but can’t complain! The large tea is 4.25$ with taxes & macaroons are 6 for 11$. Hope they have more other dessert options soon!",
        "time": 1576268093,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This is the second time I’ve left without ordering because of how slow the service is. There were three people working, but it still took over 10 minutes just to move through the line. The customers who ordered before me were still waiting on the other side. They either need better training or more staff during busy times. It’s frustrating, especially when places like Presotea offer faster service and better-quality drinks.",
        "time": 1753567387,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anthony Cafiti",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112642535948646280499/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWa72Rc6hQ_h6f8QiWsP2XQBda9lkhkb_XstnXfVVfojnMtLUaD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
